016 is \"Phase transition from egalitarian to hierarchical societies driven by competition between cognitive and social constraints\".\n3. The word appearing in both is **egalitarian**.\n\nANSWER: egalitarian","toolCallId":"call_e9602e8f32f249db8a416c74","name":"task"}
